cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Med Spa Regulations — an open citation dataset"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "MedSpaRadar"
    website: "https://medsparadar.com"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://medsparadar.com/data"
repository-code: "https://github.com/michaelepeck-beep/med-spa-rules-dataset"
keywords:
  - med spa regulation
  - medical spa law
  - scope of practice
  - corporate practice of medicine
  - state licensing
  - aesthetic medicine
abstract: >-
  One row per US state and med-spa regulatory question (1,094 rows, 51 jurisdictions,
  27 questions), naming the statute or board rule the answer was read from, the URL it
  was read at, and the date of that read. The dataset records which document was
  consulted; it does not state what the rule permits.
